// inserts "7" under recover-poison guard, waits again. Handler computing a true
// result waits twice at the SAME Barrier. Join canceller; assert wire contains
// `"code":-32800`, does NOT contain `"result":true`. Missing exact public
// Barrier/OS spawn+join contract and W38 cancellable_response borrowed FnOnce;
